1
00:00:00,521 --> 00:00:03,021
(Bernadette:)I love
that you have the confidence

2
00:00:03,024 --> 00:00:06,764
(Bernadette:)to speak, even without giving it
an ounce of thought.

3
00:00:07,895 --> 00:00:10,425
(Howard:)And I love how your hair
is always on the soap.

4
00:00:10,431 --> 00:00:13,201
(Howard:)It's like washing myself
with a hamster.

5
00:00:13,201 --> 00:00:14,701
(knocking on door)

6
00:00:14,702 --> 00:00:17,702
(Raj:)Hey, guys.
Sorry I am so late.

7
00:00:17,705 --> 00:00:20,575
(Raj:)I was on the phone
with my mother.

8
00:00:20,575 --> 00:00:21,705
(Bernadette:)Oh, how is she?

9
00:00:21,709 --> 00:00:22,939
(Raj:)Pretty good.

10
00:00:22,944 --> 00:00:25,044
(Raj:)She bought the book
Eat, Pray, Love

11
00:00:25,046 --> 00:00:28,146
(Raj:)and used it to set my father's
Mercedes on fire.

12
00:00:29,917 --> 00:00:33,557
(Raj:)So, what's up with you guys?

13
00:00:33,554 --> 00:00:36,384
(Howard:)We're just saying all the things
we love about each other.

14
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,990
(Raj:)Oh, like you and I
did at couples therapy.

15
00:00:49,103 --> 00:00:50,403
Ooh, what'd you get?

16
00:00:50,404 --> 00:00:52,434
(Sheldon:)Oh, I ordered it
before your surgery.

17
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:56,040
(Sheldon:)It's the urn I was going
to put you in.

18
00:00:57,245 --> 00:00:58,415
(Penny:)Okay, that's morbid.

19
00:00:58,412 --> 00:00:59,812
(Penny:)Send it back.

20
00:00:59,814 --> 00:01:04,454
(Sheldon:)I can't send it back--
I had it engraved.

21
00:01:04,452 --> 00:01:07,922
"Here lie the ashes
of Leonard Hofstadter.

22
00:01:07,922 --> 00:01:12,162
(Sheldon:)He thought he was right,
but his roommate knew better."

23
00:01:14,095 --> 00:01:15,595
(Leonard:)That's funny.

24
00:01:15,596 --> 00:01:17,566
(Leonard:)Boy, I'm gonna miss
these painkillers.

25
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
(Penny:)Hey, why did you get two?

26
00:01:21,002 --> 00:01:24,072
"I'm with stupid."
Oh, that one's mine.

